{"id":"659456","name":"茄子烧毛豆","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659456/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"毛豆","amount":"367克"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"3根"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"零卡糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：毛豆、茄子。","img":"images/659456/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将毛豆剥壳淘洗干净。","img":"images/659456/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将茄子去蒂清洗清洗捞出。","img":"images/659456/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放在案板上切成滚刀块。","img":"images/659456/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入切好的茄子和毛豆翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/659456/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接着，加适量的清水。","img":"images/659456/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/659456/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/659456/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的零卡糖。","img":"images/659456/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味烧煮5到6分钟。","img":"images/659456/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"然后，加适量的味精。","img":"images/659456/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻匀即成。","img":"images/659456/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}